; THE BROKEN CONCOURSE (the finish run, Act IV) — the processional terraces between the landing and
; the void rift. The road climbs across them; what is left of the colonnade stands off the road on
; the upper terrace (world ~2790, -1868). The assault's encounters (data/encounters/Celestial*.tres)
; meet the player on this ground. No pin: it is road, not a place.
